[00:29.41] Awakened by the sunlight
[00:33.16] Victimized by last light
[00:36.98] Memories flashing through my head
[00:39.90] Was I just born or am I dead?
[00:43.92] Yesterday's forgotten, the morning after
[00:50.09] I can taste you, I can hear your laughter
[01:11.91] Fading in the distance
[01:14.98] Recollections drifting
[01:17.92] Bloodstains on my tattered clothes
[01:21.92] Each minute the fear grows
[01:25.80] If I could just lay down to rest
[01:31.96] I'm tired of searching for myself
[01:39.18] If I am dead, how can I feel such love?
[01:42.75] If I am dead, why am I dreaming?
[01:46.14] If I am dead, where do I go from here?
[01:49.75] If I am dead, why does this pain feel so good?
[02:13.90] Is this my blood dried upon my face?
[02:17.17] Or is it the love of someone else?
[02:20.95] It tastes so sweet, just like you used to
[02:23.93] So rescue me my love, splice us together
[02:27.99] I remember loving you so much
[02:34.93] But where are you and where's your fatal touch?
[02:41.93] When I closed my eyes, was it my siesta?
[02:48.77] Did I encounter a darkness stronger than sleep?
[02:55.26] If I am dead, how can I feel such love?
[02:58.94] If I am dead, why am I dreaming?
[03:02.17] If I am dead, where do I go from here?
[03:05.95] If I am dead, why does this pain feel so good?
[03:23.43] I am thirsty for my sleep
[03:30.15] There are no answers anyway